   319	\begin{align}
   320	x&= -\frac{4 N (2 N u+v)}{(u-1) (4 N+u-1)},  \label{eq-x}\\
   321	y&= -\frac{4 N \left(4 N+u^2-1\right) \left(8 N^2 u+4 N u+4 N v-4 N+u^2-2 u+1\right)}{(u-1)^2 (4 N+u-1)^2}\label{eq-y}
   322	\end{align}
   323	to $\CN$. This transformation leads to % resulting equation %factors in a quartic (\dc{I don't understand ``factors in a quartic" here}) 
