"""Verified generator for cardinality-constrained minimal connected edge domination.

The paper's Proposition 1 characterises a minimal connected edge dominating set
as a tree whose pendant edges all have private edges.  This module uses that
characterisation in reverse.  It samples an independent dominating set I in a
regular graph H, places H on the leaves of a star, and returns the star spokes
outside I.  Every retained spoke has a private H-edge into I.

